  "url": "https://images-assets.nasa.gov/video/What%20Are%20the%20Dangers%20of%20Going%20to%20Space/What%20Are%20the%20Dangers%20of%20Going%20to%20Space~mobile.mp4",
  "title": "What Are the Dangers of Going to Space | We Asked a NASA Expert",
  "language": "en",
  "origin": "creator-captions",
  "producer": "publisher-subtitles",
  "recordedAt": "2026-11-15",
  "source": "https://images-assets.nasa.gov/video/What%20Are%20the%20Dangers%20of%20Going%20to%20Space/What%20Are%20the%20Dangers%20of%20Going%20to%20Space.srt",
  "segments": [
    {
      "startSec": 0.1,
      "endSec": 3.136,
      "text": "What are the dangers of going to space?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 3.803,
      "endSec": 5.2379999999999995,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Scientist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 5.538,
      "endSec": 8.541,
      "text": "What are the dangers of going into space?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 8.575,
      "endSec": 9.743,
      "text": "For human spaceflight,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 9.743,
      "endSec": 11.144,
      "text": "the first thing I think about"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 11.144,
      "endSec": 12.779,
      "text": "is the astronauts"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 12.779,
      "endSec": 15.548,
      "text": "actually strapping themselves to a rocket."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 15.548,
      "endSec": 18.051,
      "text": "And if that isn't dangerous enough,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 18.051,
      "endSec": 19.219,
      "text": "once they launch"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 19.219,
      "endSec": 22.389,
      "text": "and they're out into space in deep exploration,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 22.789,
      "endSec": 25.291,
      "text": "we have to worry about radiation."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 25.291,
      "endSec": 28.094,
      "text": "Radiation is coming at them from all directions."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 28.094,
      "endSec": 30.597,
      "text": "From the Sun, we have solar particles."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 30.597,
      "endSec": 32.499,
      "text": "We have galactic cosmic rays"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 32.499,
      "endSec": 34.601,
      "text": "that are all over in the universe."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 34.601,
      "endSec": 37.771,
      "text": "And those cause damage to DNA."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 37.837,
      "endSec": 38.638,
      "text": "On Earth here,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 38.638,
      "endSec": 42.442,
      "text": "we use sunscreen to protect us from DNA damage."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 42.542,
      "endSec": 44.911,
      "text": "Our astronauts are protected from the shielding"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 44.911,
      "endSec": 47.08,
      "text": "that's around them in the space vehicles."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 47.08,
      "endSec": 49.616,
      "text": "We also have to worry about microgravity."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 49.616,
      "endSec": 51.217,
      "text": "So what happens there?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 51.217,
      "endSec": 52.552,
      "text": "We see a lot of bone"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 52.552,
      "endSec": 54.421,
      "text": "and muscle loss in our astronauts."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 54.421,
      "endSec": 56.089,
      "text": "And so to prevent this,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 56.089,
      "endSec": 57.791,
      "text": "we actually have the astronauts"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 57.791,
      "endSec": 60.794,
      "text": "exercising for hours every day."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 61.061,
      "endSec": 63.696,
      "text": "And of course we don't want to run out of food"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 63.696,
      "endSec": 65.565,
      "text": "on a space exploration mission."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 65.565,
      "endSec": 66.699,
      "text": "So we want to make sure"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 66.699,
      "endSec": 68.001,
      "text": "that we have everything"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 68.001,
      "endSec": 70.236,
      "text": "that the astronauts need to take with them"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 70.236,
      "endSec": 72.138,
      "text": "to make sure that we can sustain them."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 72.138,
      "endSec": 74.174,
      "text": "There are many risks associated"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 74.174,
      "endSec": 76.276,
      "text": "with human space exploration."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 76.276,
      "endSec": 77.377,
      "text": "NASA has been planning"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 77.377,
      "endSec": 78.311,
      "text": "for these missions"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 78.311,
      "endSec": 81.581,
      "text": "to make our astronauts return home safely."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 83.85,
      "endSec": 85.018,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Scientist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 85.018,
      "endSec": 88.488,
      "text": "NASA. A NASA 360 Production."
    }
  ]
}
